[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    30[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   same write kills it with signal 13.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    31[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    32[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - **Fix**: `restore_default_sigpipe()` in `src/main.rs` resets `SIGPIPE` to
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    33[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `SIG_DFL` (via `extern "C" signal`) as the first statement of `main`, under
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    34[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `#[cfg(unix)]`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    35[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
